WEBVTT

00:38.649 --> 00:46.595
You wanted pop You wanted clean A hollow sound

00:46.695 --> 00:53.881
from a thin machine You tried to tune me out You

00:53.901 --> 00:59.231
tried to change the dial But I've been waiting

00:59.572 --> 01:03.887
all this while

01:06.002 --> 01:11.726
I am the static, I am the noise The signal

01:11.847 --> 01:20.033
breaking, the hidden voice I am the static, the

01:20.173 --> 01:27.158
feedback whale The story that you try to derail

01:39.445 --> 01:46.467
This isn't simple. This isn't grace. This is the

01:46.567 --> 01:53.829
sound of a different place. This is the heart you

01:53.849 --> 01:56.649
try to hide.

01:58.470 --> 02:08.924
The part of us that never dies. I am the static, I

02:09.104 --> 02:15.605
am the noise The signal breaking, the hidden

02:15.665 --> 02:23.067
voice I am the static, the feedback whale The

02:23.087 --> 02:28.528
story that you try to derail

02:36.599 --> 02:38.223
Thank you.

03:06.318 --> 03:12.965
I am the static, I am the noise, the signal

03:13.205 --> 03:21.433
breaking, the hidden voice. I am the static, the

03:21.513 --> 03:27.940
feedback whale, the story that you try to

03:28.000 --> 03:38.148
derail. I am the static, I am the static Can you

03:38.188 --> 03:39.049
hear me now?

